{{#> page title="Corporate courses - Instincts Training"}}
  <section class="bg-neutral-600 text-neutral-50 relative">
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:flex">
      <div class="space-y-8 px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 md:w-1/2">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold">
            Our corporate courses
          </h1>
          <div class="text-lg lg:text-2xl">
            We offer a range of corporate courses covering a variety of topics, all of which can be tailored to better
            suit your needs
          </div>
        </div>
        <img class="md:hidden" src="/img/IMG_0605.jpg">
      </div>
      <img class="hidden md:block md:w-1/2 md:object-cover xl:absolute xl:right-0 xl:h-full" src="/img/IMG_0605.jpg">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-stone-100 text-neutral-600">
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 grid md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-x-8 gap-y-8
                items-center">
      <div class="space-y-6 md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold">
          Basic personal safety
        </h2>
        <p class="lg:text-lg">
          Our basic personal safety course will give you knowledge in how to spot and avoid trouble, then if all else
          fails a few simple personal safety/breakaway techniques to get you away from the trouble and home safe. Very
          few fights/attacks are a total surprise and if you can read the situation correctly you will be able to walk
          away before any escalation into violence. Random attacks do happen, but they are such a small percentage of
          overall violent situations.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img class="object-cover max-h-60 sm:max-h-96 md:max-h-full w-full md:col-span-4 md:row-start-1"
        src="/img/IMG_0657.jpg">
      <p class="lg:text-lg md:col-span-7 md:col-start-1">
        All our courses incorporate self-awareness and situational awareness, meaning you should be able to spot even
        a potential random attack if you follow common sense and the subtle signs and definitely be able to walk away
        from the usual street violence we see in the UK. We will cover the signs of trouble, body language, verbal
        escalation, conflict resolution and de-escalation. We will cover UK law and personal safety, the do’s and don’ts
        and potential pitfalls you could face with common myths and misconceptions that are widely spread in society.
      </p>
      <img class="object-cover max-h-60 sm:max-h-96 md:max-h-full w-full md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9"
        src="/img/IMG_0663.jpg">
      <p class="lg:text-lg md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6">
        We cover how the body and mind react to a fearful situation and the implications this can bring if you lose
        control, (easier said than done but we can teach breathing techniques and awareness to calm you down in a
        violent encounter). If all else has failed we will teach you very simple but effective personal safety moves
        that if done correctly will get you out of a violent encounter. These moves are tried and tested through years
        of experience from myself and my mentors, plus other training partners who have worked in violent environments
        such as security and door supervisors.
      </p>
      <img class="object-cover max-h-60 sm:max-h-96 md:max-h-full w-full md:col-span-4 md:row-start-3"
        src="/img/IMG_0672.jpg">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-600">
    <div class="max-w-screen-lg mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 space-y-8">
      <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold">
          Specialised courses
        </h2>
        <p class="lg:text-lg">
          The following courses incorporate the fundamentals of the basic personal safety course, then specialise in the
          actual topic.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-neutral-400">
        {{#> accordion-item index=1 title="Personal safety"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            A practical and realistic course designed to help people recognise risk, improve awareness and make safer
            decisions.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Participants explore situational awareness, body language, boundaries, positioning, escape options and
            practical personal safety techniques.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The focus is not on fear. It is about knowledge, awareness and understanding what you can do.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=2 title="Conflict resolution & de-escalation" cpd-certified=true}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Learn how to recognise the early signs of conflict and understand how situations can escalate.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course explores body language, tone of voice, communication, trigger words and practical de-escalation
            techniques. Participants also learn how to remain assertive without unnecessarily increasing tension.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Where appropriate, practical breakaway techniques can also be included.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=3 title="Female self defence & women's personal safety" cpd-certified=true}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            A practical approach to personal safety that recognises the different risks and realities women may face.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course covers awareness, boundaries, positioning, mindset and practical self-defence options, while
            taking physiology and realistic responses into account.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Topics can also include sexual predators and sexual attacks where required.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The focus is on understanding what you can do, rather than what you cannot.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=4 title="Adult self defence"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Realistic, practical self-defence for adults.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            This course focuses on awareness, prevention, creating opportunities to escape and practical techniques for
            when avoidance is no longer possible.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            No Hollywood moves. No false promises.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Just practical knowledge and techniques designed around real-life situations.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=5 title="Lone work safety" cpd-certified=true}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Designed for anyone who works alone or regularly visits clients, properties or unfamiliar locations.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course covers risk awareness, dynamic risk assessment, escape planning, environmental awareness, body
            language, warning signs, positioning, communication and de-escalation.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Participants also explore practical personal safety and breakaway techniques, along with the importance of
            reporting and understanding workplace responsibilities.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=6 title="Control & restraint PMVA"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Practical training for environments where physical intervention may sometimes be necessary.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course focuses on decision-making, awareness, communication and safer methods of control and restraint,
            with an emphasis on responsibility and reducing unnecessary harm.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Training can be adapted to suit the role, workplace and level of intervention required.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=7 title="The everyday reset"}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Practical tools for real life.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The Everyday Reset gives participants simple, realistic tools to help manage stress, emotional ups and downs
            and the pressures of everyday life.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Through guided reflection, body awareness, practical techniques and supportive discussion, participants
            explore ways to reset, refocus and create small changes that can fit into everyday routines.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            This is practical, interactive and focused on tools people can actually use.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
        {{#> accordion-item index=8 title="Personal safety instructor training" cpd-certified=true}}
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Designed for people who want to develop the knowledge and skills to teach basic personal safety to others.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            The course covers the core elements of personal safety while also developing the confidence and ability to
            deliver the training effectively.
          </p>
          <p class="lg:text-lg">
            Successful participants receive ongoing support from Instincts Training and complete regular updates and
            competency assessments to maintain their skills and knowledge.
          </p>
        {{/accordion-item}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-stone-100 text-neutral-600">
    <div class="max-w-screen-md mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-16 lg:py-32 space-y-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold">Ready to learn?</h2>
      <p class="lg:text-lg">
        All the courses mentioned above with the exception of personal safety instructor can be tailored to a bespoke
        package to suit individual needs. The basic personal safety course is available to children from secondary
        school upwards with age-appropriate applications being taught and understood. Everything we do is based on
        reality and society.
      </p>
      <p class="lg:text-lg">
        We will sit down with you if required to discuss in detail how we can help and make sure we tick all your boxes
        for your specific requirements. We can assess risk assessments and make sure your policy is relevant and within
        the law for your establishment in accordance with the Health and Safety at Work Act and Employment Law. Our
        mission is to keep things relevant and real; we teach personal safety techniques that are proven to work.
      </p>
      {{#> link-button style="dark" href="/contact"}}Contact{{/link-button}}
    </div>
  </section>
{{/page}}
